      "text": "Relative risks (RRs) or standardized mean differences (SMDs) with 95% confidence intervals (CIs) were calculated for dichotomous and continuous outcomes, respectively. As clinical heterogeneity and methodological heterogeneity are inevitable at any time, we performed a meta-analysis using a random effect model.",
